  "description": "The Alpine Trail E XR sheds pounds and adds thrills. Our all-new Series 4 Aluminum frame is slimmed down but still packs a ride-all-day, removable 800Wh battery. Personalize your ride and devour chunky terrain with adjustable geometry, while 160mm of MultiTrac 2 LT suspension keeps you flowing. Experience superhuman climbing power of Bosch's 120Nm, 600 per cent assist Gen 5 CX motor. Track your stats with the 2in color Kiox top tube display. RockShox Zeb and Vivid Ultimate shocks pair with SRAM's wireless GX Transmission and Maven brakes to keep you flying. It’s enduro eMTB perfection.",
